  "verseCount": 44,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwakhala kuElisha umfazi womunye umprofethi wathi: Inceku yakho umkami sewafa; uyazi ukuba inceku yakho yayiyesaba iNkosi, sekufikile umuntu esilesikwilidi sakhe ukuba athathe abantwana bami ababili, babe yizigqili zakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UElisha wathi kuye: Ngingakwenzelani na? Ulani endlini na? Yena wathi: Incekukazi yakho kayilalutho, kuphela igabha lamafutha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesithi: Hamba uyekweboleka izimbiza komakhelwana bakho bonke, zibe zinengi zingelalutho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nxa usubuyile uzivalele endlini labantwana bakho, uchathekele amafutha asegabheni kuzo zonke imbiza ezigcweleyo, uzibeke eceleni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owesifazana wasesukake wazivalela endlini labantwana bakhe; bamqhubela izimbiza, wathela amafutha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sezigcwele wathi komunye umntanakhe: Letha enye imbiza. Yena wathi: Kayisekho enye. Amafutha kazabe esaphuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasebuyela kumuntu kaNkulunkulu wayamazisa, yena wathi: Hambake uyethengisa lawomafutha, uhlawule izikwilidi zakho; aseleyo uzondle ngawo wena labantwana bakho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ngolunye usuku uElisha wadlula eShunemi lapho kwakuhlala khona owesifazana onothileyo owamncenga ukuba ake adle ukudla. Kwakuye kuthi lapho esedlula, aphambukele khona adle ukudla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owesifazana wasesithi kumkakhe: Ngiyabona ukuthi lumuntu ohlala esedlula lapha ungumuntu ongcwele kaNkulunkulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asimakhele indlwana phezu kophahla, simfakele umbheda letafula lesihlalo lesibane, kuthi lapho efikile kithi ahlale khona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngolunye usuku uElisha wafika khona, wangena endlwaneni waphumula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesithi kuGehazi inceku yakhe: Ngibizela lowowesifazana womShunami. Kwathi esembizile, weza phambi kwakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UElisha wasesithi kuye: Tshono kuye uthi: Khangela, usenzele konke lokhu, thina singakwenzelani na? Uthanda ukuba sikukhulumele enkosini kumbe enduneni yempi na? Waphendula wathi: Atshi, ngihlala phakathi kwabantu bakithi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UElisha wasesithi: Pho, singamenzelani na? UGehazi waphendula wathi: Khangela, kalamntwana, lomkakhe useluphele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesithi: Mbize. Esembizile, weza wema emnyango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UElisha wathi kuye: Ngalesisikhathi ngomnyaka ozayo uzagona umntwana. Kodwa yena wathi: Atshi, nkosi yami, wena muntu kaNkulunkulu, ungayikhohlisi incekukazi yakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa owesifazana wakhulelwa, wabeletha umntwana ngalesosikhathi ngomnyaka olandelayo, njengokutsho kukaElisha kuye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi umntwana esekhulile, waya kuyise ngolunye usuku kwabavunayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasememeza kuyise esithi: Ngafa likhanda! ngafa likhanda! Uyise wathi encekwini yakhe: Mthwale umuse kunina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isimthwele yamusa kunina, umntwana wahlala emathangazini kanina kwaze kwaba semini, wasesifa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unina wasekhwela esiya phezulu, wamlalisa embhedeni womuntu kaNkulunkulu, waphuma wamvalela khona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasememeza umkakhe esithi: Ake ungithumele enye inceku lomunye ubabhemi, ukuba ngihambe masinyane ngiye emuntwini kaNkulunkulu, ngibuye futhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi. Ulandani kuye lamhla na? Kakusilo usuku lokuthwasa kwenyanga loba olweSabatha. Yena wathi: Kakusilutho lokho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eselungisiwe ubabhemi, wathi encekwini yakhe: Mtshaye ahambe, ungamyekeli adonde uba ngingakutsheli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahambake, wayafika emuntwini kaNkulunkulu entabeni iKarmeli. Kwathi umuntu kaNkulunkulu embona esiza, wathi kuGehazi inceku yakhe: Khangela, nanguyana owesifazana womShunami; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gijima masinyane umhlangabeze, uthi kuye: Kunjani? Lomkakho unjani? Umntwana uyaphila kuhle na? Owesifazana waphendula wathi: Konke kulungile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi esefikile entabeni kumuntu kaNkulunkulu wadumela inyawo zakhe. UGehazi wasondela ukumsusa. Kodwa umuntu kaNkulunkulu wathi: Myekele, ngoba ulosizi olukhulu, leNkosi ingifihlele lokhu, kayingitshelanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owesifazana wathi: Ngangicelile umntwana enkosini yami na? Kangitshongo yini ukuthi ungangikhohlisi na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UElisha wasesithi kuGehazi: Khwica izigqoko zakho, uthathe lodondolo lwami, uhambe. Uba uhlangana lomuntu ungambingeleli, uba umuntu ekubingelela ungamphenduli; ubeke loludondolo lwami ebusweni bomntwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unina womntwana wasesithi: Ngifunga iNkosi uNkulunkulu kanye lawe uqobo, kangiyikukutshiya. Wasesukuma emlandela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UGehazi wahamba ngaphambili, walubeka udondolo ebusweni bomntwana, kodwa kakubanga khona ilizwi loba ukudikiza. Wasebuyelake ukuhlangabeza uElisha, wathi kuye: Umntwana kavukanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.31",
